<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Sea of Fire</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Original Concept By:&lt;/B&gt; Paul Bridge&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; May 25th 1982 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; North-West of the Falkland Islands &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; Argentina &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 6 Hours&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;On 25th May 1982, A-4B Skyhawks from Grupo 5 were given a mission specifically targeted at HMS Coventry and HMS Broadsword. The two ships had been on picket duty north-west of the Falkland Islands, acting as both early warning and the first layer of defence for the British carrier group. They had become quite a thorn in the side for the Argentine forces, and as a result, raids were scheduled against the ships.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
